# Villain Codex - Oracle Ascetic Mystery
SOURCELONG:Villain Codex	SOURCESHORT:VC	SOURCEDATE:2017-11

Ascetic Mysteries	KEY:Oracle ~ Ascetic Mystery	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleMystery	DEFINE:AsceticMysteriesQualify|0	DESC:You have honed body and spirit through relentless discipline, drawing upon the divine mystery of the ascetic to grant your spells and powers.	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|Ascetic Mystery ~ Final Revelation|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=20],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_FinalRevelation,0]	ABILITY:Internal|AUTOMATIC|Ascetic Mysteries Class Skills|PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySkills,0	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Ascetic Mystery Revelation|OracleMysteryLevel	BONUS:VAR|AsceticMysteriesQualify|1	SOURCEPAGE:p.104	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=1|Stone Fist|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=2],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell2,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=2|Glide|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=4],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell4,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=3|Force Punch|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=6],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell6,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=4|Ethereal Fists|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=8],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell8,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=5|Contact Other Plane|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=10],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell10,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=6|Legend Lore|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=12],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell12,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=7|Vision|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=14],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell14,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=8|Frightful Aspect|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=16],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell16,0]	SPELLKNOWN:CLASS|Oracle=9|Iron Body|PREMULT:2,[PRECLASS:1,Oracle=18],[PREVAREQ:Oracle_CF_MysterySpell18,0]
Ascetic Mysteries Class Skills	CATEGORY:Internal	CSKILL:Acrobatics|Climb|Escape Artist|Swim

# --- Revelations
Absence of Body	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Absence of Body	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Supernatural	DESC:You require half as much food and water to survive as a normal member of your race. Additionally, each time you hold your breath, you can do so for an additional number of rounds equal to your oracle level. At 15th level, you no longer need to eat or drink and can hold your breath for 10 times as long (2 minutes per point of Constitution, plus 1 additional minute per oracle level).	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Absence of Form	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Absence of Form	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.SpellLike	DEFINE:AsceticAbsenceOfFormRounds|0	DESC:You gain feather fall as a spell-like ability, which you can use a number of rounds per day equal to your oracle level. The rounds do not need to be used consecutively. If you are in mid fall when this ability's duration expires, you take falling damage as if you fell from the altitude you were at when the spell ended. At 10th level, you can also apply your daily rounds of this ability to use air walk.	BONUS:VAR|AsceticAbsenceOfFormRounds|classlevel("Oracle")	SPELLS:Ascetic Absence of Form|TIMES=AsceticAbsenceOfFormRounds|CASTERLEVEL=classlevel("Oracle")|Feather Fall	SPELLS:Ascetic Absence of Form|TIMES=AsceticAbsenceOfFormRounds|CASTERLEVEL=classlevel("Oracle")|Air Walk|PRECLASS:1,Oracle=10	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Ascetic Armor	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Ascetic Armor	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Supernatural	DEFINE:AsceticArmorBonus|0	DEFINE:AsceticArmorLVL|0	DEFINE:AsceticArmorHasArmor|0	DEFINE:AsceticArmorEncumbered|0	DEFINE:AsceticArmorRestricted|0	DESC:You can use meditative techniques that temporarily cause attacks to bounce off your skin, as long as you aren't wearing armor or carrying a medium or heavy load. These techniques grant you a +%1 armor bonus to AC. At 7th level, and every 4 levels thereafter, this bonus increases by 2. At 13th level, the techniques also grant DR 5/unarmed strikes or natural attacks. You can gain the benefits of ascetic armor for 1 hour per day per oracle level. The hours do not need to be consecutive, but you must spend them in 1-hour increments.|AsceticArmorBonus	BONUS:VAR|AsceticArmorLVL|classlevel("Oracle")|TYPE=Level	BONUS:VAR|AsceticArmorHasArmor|1|PREVARGTEQ:var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.EQUIPPED]"),1	BONUS:VAR|AsceticArmorEncumbered|1|PREVARGTEQ:ENCUMBERANCE,1	BONUS:VAR|AsceticArmorRestricted|AsceticArmorHasArmor+AsceticArmorEncumbered|TYPE=Boolean	BONUS:VAR|AsceticArmorBonus|4+2*min(4,max(0,(AsceticArmorLVL-3)/4))	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|AsceticArmorBonus|TYPE=Armor|PREVAREQ:AsceticArmorRestricted,0	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Fleet	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Fleet	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Extraordinary	!PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Oracle ~ Lame	DEFINE:AsceticFleetBonus|0	DESC:You gain a +%1-foot enhancement bonus to your base land speed. You lose this extra speed if you wear any armor or carry a medium or heavy load. At 7th level, and every 6 levels thereafter, this bonus increases by 10 feet.|AsceticFleetBonus	BONUS:VAR|AsceticFleetBonus|10+10*min(3,max(0,(classlevel("Oracle")-1)/6))	BONUS:MOVEADD|TYPE=Walk|AsceticFleetBonus|PREVARLT:ENCUMBERANCE,1,var("COUNT[EQTYPE.ARMOR.EQUIPPED]"),1	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Martial Disciple	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Martial Disciple	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Supernatural	DESC:Through meditation and study of monastic forms of combat, you have learned a lethal form of unarmed combat. You gain Improved Unarmed Strike as a bonus feat, even if you do not meet the prerequisites. You gain the unarmed strike damage of a monk of your oracle level. If you also have monk levels, those levels stack for the purpose of determining your unarmed strike damage.	ABILITY:FEAT|VIRTUAL|Improved Unarmed Strike	BONUS:UDAM|CLASS.Monk|classlevel("Oracle")	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Oracular Spellstrike	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Oracular Spellstrike	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Supernatural	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=7	DESC:By harnessing a synergy of unarmed combat and spellcasting, you have uncovered a means of channeling spell energy quickly through your unarmed strikes. This resembles the magus spellstrike ability, except it works with unarmed strikes only, no matter what other abilities you have. Additionally, it uses spells from the cleric spell list, not the magus spell list. You must be at least 7th level before selecting this revelation.	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Rapid Convalescence	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Rapid Convalescence	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Supernatural	DESC:You reduce the number of consecutive successful saves needed to recover from a disease or poison by 1 (to a minimum of 1). Additionally, you can sacrifice one of your unused spell slots for the day to gain an enhancement bonus equal to that spell slot's level on your next save to resist the effects of poison or disease, provided the save is attempted within 1 minute per level of spell expended.	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
Spell Deflection	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Spell Deflection	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.OracleRevelation.AsceticRevelation.Supernatural	PRECLASS:1,Oracle=11	DESC:You can use a readied action to counterspell any spell being cast on you or an adjacent ally that requires a ranged touch attack (such as a ray). In order to successfully counter the spell, you must make an unarmed attack roll. If the result of this attack roll is higher than 20 + the spell's caster level, the spell is negated with no effect. At 17th level, any spell you successfully negate is reflected back at the caster with the same ranged touch attack result. You must be at least 11th level before selecting this revelation.	SOURCEPAGE:p.104

# --- Final Revelation (no official version; PFS clarification grants the monk's Perfect Self)
Final Revelation	KEY:Ascetic Mystery ~ Final Revelation	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:OracleClassFeatures.SpecialQuality.FinalRevelation	DESC:You have become a magical creature. You are forevermore treated as an outsider rather than as a humanoid (or whatever your creature type was) for the purpose of spells and magical effects. Additionally, you gain damage reduction 10/chaotic, which allows you to ignore the first 10 points of damage from any attack made by a nonchaotic weapon or by any natural attack made by a creature that doesn't have similar damage reduction. Unlike other outsiders, you can still be brought back from the dead as if you were a member of your previous creature type. (No Final Revelation exists as printed for the Ascetic mystery; per the Pathfinder Society Campaign Clarifications this mystery grants the monk's Perfect Self ability. This is not official errata.)	DR:10/Chaotic	SOURCEPAGE:p.104
